===Pokémon Adventures===
The Champion of each region is the winner of an elimination tournament held every three years in each region. In the {{MangaArc|Ruby & Sapphire}}, it was determined that the winners of each tournament would have to face the [[Elite Four]], each a former Champion themselves, before challenging the Champion. The main characters that have taken part in a Pokémon League tournament so far are {{adv|Red}}, {{adv|Blue}}, {{adv|Green}}, and {{adv|Black}}. Of the four, Red and Black both won a tournament, though only Red was formally given the title of Champion.

According to Blue in the {{MangaArc|Red, Green & Blue}}, every Trainer who has earned the title of Champion by winning the [[Indigo League]] Tournament has come from [[Pallet Town]].

